WEBVTT

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:06.660
Yusei, get my revenge!

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:11.870
Sherry!

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.670
Where am I?

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:24.030
If you want to know the 
truth, I will tell you.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:28.680
But knowing the truth will 
greatly change your destiny.

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:30.210
I don't mind.

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:35.040
I want to know what's really going on!

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:44.830
What's this?

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.680
Your future.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:50.800
Moment destroyed the world.

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.240
Destroyed?

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:11.980
The Circuit is almost complete.

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:18.340
The Circuit will be completed 
when we win the WRGP Finals.

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:23.140
Everything is as planned.  
Ark Cradle will appear.

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:26.800
We'll use our true power in the finals.

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:35.050
When I was reborn, Zone the Creator 
told me about our secret power.

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:37.470
Secret power?

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.550
How's everyone?

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:43.970
How are you the night before the finals?

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:53.500
You're working late.

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:55.490
Oh, it's you.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:57.990
It's unusual for the Director 
to bring refreshments.

00:01:57.990 --> 00:01:59.330
Good evening!

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:01.950
What are you doing here?

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:03.000
What about you?

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.200
Covering a story, of course.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:07.220
Where is everyone?

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:08.260
Well...

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:10.100
There's no one here.

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:13.780
Hmm, maybe they're...

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:24.740
You can see the floating island again?

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.670
Yes.  It's come a little closer.

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:37.160
It's real!  I can see it via Luca's mark!

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:39.820
That's humanity's final Moment.

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:43.150
My father said that I can't 
allow it to approach.

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:46.650
That island is going to 
appear at Neo Domino City?

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:48.110
Yeah.

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:49.430
There they are!

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:51.070
So they're here.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:55.290
But they look serious.

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:01.990
Those three are from Iliaster!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.020
I sense a huge scoop!

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:09.000
Like I thought, the Crimson Dragon's 
Signers have made the finals.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.470
Everything is just as planned.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:14.860
Placido, Jose and Lucciano!

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:20.200
What's that island?  Does Iliaster 
have something to do with it?

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.670
I'll tell you.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.120
That is Ark Cradle, god's castle.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:27.430
The land where Ileidos sleeps.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.190
Ark Cradle?

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:34.190
When Team New World wins the WRGP,

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:39.880
Ark Cradle will show its true self and 
land on the earth.  At that time...

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:45.000
Neo Domino City will be destroyed, 
and the world will be reborn.

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.680
Neo Domino City?

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:53.600
Destroyed?

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:54.680
Oh no!

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:59.680
Team New World is Iliaster, the secret 
organization that controls the world?

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:02.720
What's going on, Jack?

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:09.500
What's that?  Is it going 
to destroy the city?

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.690
Yeah.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:12.850
That's horrible!

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:13.680
Huh?

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:18.100
Why?

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:22.240
Why can't I see it?  I can't get the scoop!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.430
How do we stop it?

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:26.730
It's the chestnut-headed clown.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.240
I heard that you became the Director.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:32.490
That's right!  To protect this city!

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:34.730
So tell me!

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:38.130
Then defeat us.

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.190
Even though that's impossible.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:46.350
We'll show you our true power 
in tomorrow's finals, Team 5D's.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:52.280
The fate of the city is in our hands.

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:54.400
And the fate of the world.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:56.870
That is your destiny.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:02.480
Team Ragnarok!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:08.880
The only way to save the 
world is to defeat them.

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:14.380
Our Rune Eyes have the power 
to save the world from danger.

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:21.590
The Rune Eyes have entrusted the Crimson 
Dragon to defeat Team New World.

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.560
If we win, we can stop it?

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.050
By winning the duel...

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:33.740
Then our mission is clear!

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:37.750
We'll use all our strength 
in tomorrow's finals!

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:41.750
And we'll win and save Neo 
Domino City and the world!

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:52.290
Riding Duels.

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:55.390
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:05:55.630 --> 00:06:02.240
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:09.910
Run!  The road of evolution 
leading to tomorrow

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:14.290
Is a new legendary duel

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:31.400
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:37.040
Set free your infinite potential

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:42.450
Every beginning is up to you

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:48.990
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:54.330
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:06:54.890 --> 00:07:00.160
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:07.940
Become the gale and dance  
Cut through the darkness

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:13.310
Even if you can't see your destination

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:18.880
Run on your feet without fear

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:24.390
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:31.430
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:51.720
The Battle for the Future!Meklord 
Emperor Skiel vs Red Nova Dragon

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:52.820
This is what I was waiting for!

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:53.720
I expect awesomeness!

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:55.680
Show us an excellent duel!

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:59.920
Go go let's go fight!

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:04.300
What can I do?

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:10.970
If Team 5D's loses, Iliaster 
will destroy Neo Domino City.

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:15.670
I want to run away with my family!

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:16.440
Director!

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:17.940
What is it?

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:22.290
Shouldn't you tell the citizens 
the truth and postpone the finals?

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:27.300
You must be kidding!  If I 
do that, it'll cause a panic!

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:30.710
Even if I tell them, where can they go?

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:36.420
We must trust Team 5D's and 
believe that they'll win!

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:42.520
The only thing we can do is believe in them!

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:48.640
It's time for the finals 
of the first-ever WRGP!

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:52.710
Today's teams made it this far 
after winning many battles!

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:56.610
Team 5D's defeated Team Ragnarok!

00:08:56.610 --> 00:09:02.260
Team New World are undefeated giants 
who are creating a new era of dueling!

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:10.450
No one knows that the fate of 
the city depends on this duel.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:11.910
Yeah.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:15.630
Master Atlas, please win!

00:09:20.010 --> 00:09:24.500
They will use Meklords and an 
anti-Synchro battle strategy.

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:27.680
And we don't know the 
power of Jose's Meklord.

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:29.280
Leave it to me!

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:33.370
We also gained new powers 
in order to fight them.

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:35.360
We're counting on you, Jack!

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:45.200
What's that?

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:46.810
Here he comes.

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:03.340
Wow!  He's going to use that to Riding Duel?

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:10.460
Let's see if you can compete 
against Wheel of Fortune!

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:14.180
You're about to find out.

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:21.940
First Wheelers Jack and Lucciano are at the 
start line, and the final duel is about to begin!

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:23.870
Duel Mode on.

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:30.300
The World Riding Duel Grand 
Prix Finals is about to begin!

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:32.290
Riding Duel!

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:35.390
Acceleration!

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:38.730
Whoa!  Lucciano is out to a fast start!

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:39.680
What?

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:42.150
Don't let him go first, Jack!

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:45.130
They simultaneously enter the corner!

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:47.590
Don't underestimate Wheel of Fortune!

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:51.590
You're fired up.  I'll let you have it.

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:57.090
Whoa!  Jack Atlas of Team 
5D's took the first corner!

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:59.680
He did it!  Jack goes first!

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:00.830
Master Atlas!

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:04.040
All right!  Now we have the advantage!

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:07.200
Duel!

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:09.060
My turn!

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:13.420
I summon the Tuner Monster Dark 
Resonator in defense position!

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:18.710
I set three cards and end my turn!

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:23.410
Will you do the same thing 
as usual and Synchro Summon?

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:27.460
It seems you've forgotten 
about our Meklords' effects.

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:32.800
Do you think that I've been wasting 
my time before this battle?

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:35.690
All that effort is pointless.

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:38.300
Stop bragging and attack me!

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:45.030
Here I go!  My turn!

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:52.970
Here I go!  My turn!

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:56.720
I summon Sky Core in defense position!

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:00.970
That's their key card!

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:03.670
Are they planning to summon a Meklord?

00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:04.140
Yeah!

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:07.090
I set three cards and end my turn!

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:10.070
Now what will you do?

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:15.650
He can Special Summon Meklord 
when an effect destroys Sky Core.

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:20.360
That means his set cards are trap cards 
that will allow him to destroy it.

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:24.950
Bring it on!  I'll crush you head-on!

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:28.280
My turn!

00:12:29.530 --> 00:12:32.680
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Dimension Switch!

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:41.000
By turning this card's effect on and off, I can 
remove from play or return a monster to my field.

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:42.480
Switch on!

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:44.820
I remove Dark Resonator from play!

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:48.140
Then I Special Summon Gear Changer!

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:57.960
When monsters are only on your side of the 
field, I can Special Summon this card.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:01.970
Then it gains Level equal 
to your monster's Level!

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:05.430
It gains Sky Core's 1 Level!

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:13.310
By turning Dimension Switch off, the monster 
that was removed from play returns to the field!

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:21.460
Level 3 Dark Resonator 
tunes Level 5 Gear Changer!

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:24.660
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:26.640
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.340
Synchro Summon!

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:31.830
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:39.800
Jack Atlas's ace monster Red Dragon 
Archfiend already appeared!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:44.770
Your strategies are simple 
because you only use power.

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:49.040
This power proves the bond of 5D's!

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:54.480
Witness the power that we 
acquired through numerous duels!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:57.750
I summon the Tuner Monster Trust Guardian!

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:08.120
When Red Dragon Archfiend is on the field, 
I can Special Summon this card from my hand!

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:10.050
Appear, Red Nova!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.580
Two Tuner Monsters.

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:22.940
My soul burns!  Witness ultimate power!

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:25.570
Burning Soul!

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:33.050
Level 3 Trust Guardian and Level 1 Red Nova 
double tune Level 8 Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:37.480
The king and devil now 
merge here!  Rugged soul!

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.950
Give the roar that created heaven and earth!

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:41.750
Synchro Summon!

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:45.360
Come, Red Nova Dragon!

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:47.750
It appeared!

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.470
Red Nova Dragon!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:55.340
This card gains 500 attack points 
for every Tuner in my graveyard.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:15:03.820
Dark Resonator, Trust Guardian and Red Nova are in my 
graveyard, so the three Tuners give 1500 attack points!

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:08.180
You're still making it stronger?  I'm amazed.

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:12.530
Red Nova Dragon attacks Sky Core!

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.930
All right, Jack!

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:20.040
If an attack destroys it, 
he can't summon a Meklord!

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:23.620
I flip over my trap card Twin Vortex!

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:27.500
This card destroys your 
monster and my monster!

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:33.390
Red Nova Dragon can't be destroyed by 
your spell, trap or monster effect!

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.030
I was aiming for this!

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:43.420
Since an effect destroyed 
Sky Core, from my deck,

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:47.310
hand or graveyard, I can Special 
Summon Meklord Emperor Skiel...

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:48.930
...Skiel Top...

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:50.770
...Skiel Attack...

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:52.940
...Skiel Guard...

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:56.210
...and Skiel Carrier!

00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:00.900
Combine, Meklord Emperor Skiel!

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:15.590
Meklord Emperor Skiel's attack points are 
equal to the total of its individual parts!

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:19.930
He already summoned it!

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:21.490
Meklord Emperor Skiel!

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.730
Its power is incredible!

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:25.350
Don't let your guard down, Jack!

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:30.820
The Synchro killer Meklord 
has finally appeared!

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:34.300
Wow!  It's cool!

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:40.200
Red Nova Dragon isn't afraid 
of 2200 attack points!

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:44.080
Red Nova Dragon attacks 
Meklord Emperor Skiel!

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:45.890
Burning Soul!

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:50.350
Skiel Guard's effect activates!

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:54.400
It can negate your monster's 
attack once per turn!

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:01.860
I already know its effects!

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:04.740
I activate my trap card Power Pressure!

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:10.480
When a monster's attack is negated, 
you take 1000 points of damage!

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:16.920
I activate the Continuous Trap Infinite Aura!

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:24.150
For every 100 points of damage, 
Infinite Aura gains one counter.

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:30.660
What is that?

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:38.360
Every time I take damage, the Continuous 
Trap Infinite Aura records that pain!

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:41.370
And when this device activates...

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:46.290
How lame!  I end my turn!

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:48.680
All right, Jack!

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:52.000
He dealt 1000 points of damage to 
Lucciano while remaining unscathed!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.340
Impressive!

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.890
Go!

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:01.960
He activated Infinite Aura.

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:04.430
Just as we planned.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.440
My turn!

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:11.070
Meklord Emperor Skiel's effect activates!

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:16.340
It can absorb a Synchro 
Monster once per turn!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:23.480
I'm taking Red Nova Dragon!

00:18:23.940 --> 00:18:25.240
I won't let you!

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:31.630
I remove Red Nova Dragon from play during 
your turn to prevent your monster from attacking!

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:39.570
How's that?  Without a target, your 
effect and attack are negated!

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:40.500
Yeah!

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:41.450
He did it!

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:44.380
As long as Jack has Red 
Nova Dragon's power...

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:46.670
He doesn't need to be afraid of Meklord!

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:47.160
Yeah!

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:49.130
How brazen.

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:52.110
I set one card and end my turn!

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:56.380
Red Nova Dragon that was removed 
from play returns at the End Phase!

00:18:56.900 --> 00:19:01.020
Whoa!  He skilfully avoided 
Team New World's strategy!

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:07.760
And standing in their way is Jack 
Atlas's newest ace, Red Nova Dragon!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:11.740
Team New World lost their 
chance for a counterattack.

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:14.800
But neither duelist can deal damage now.

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:18.800
They're both defending with their 
strongest shields, so is it a stalemate?

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:26.070
Hurry up and do something, Jack Atlas!

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:29.610
I already anticipated this situation!

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:33.960
Red Nova Dragon has nothing 
to fear from a Meklord!

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:36.350
Here I go!  My turn!

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:42.590
I summon Force Resonator!

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:47.920
By sending it to the graveyard, 
when my Synchro Monster

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:50.820
attacks this turn, you can't 
activate your monster's effect!

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:58.740
Red Nova Dragon isn't affected 
by your Meklord's effect!

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:00.560
What?

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:07.050
And since there's another Tuner in my 
graveyard, it gains 500 attack points.

00:20:07.670 --> 00:20:09.560
This battle is mine!

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:13.250
Red Nova Dragon attacks 
Meklord Emperor Skiel!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:16.560
Take this!  Burning Soul!

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:22.790
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Infinite Prison!

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:26.600
By discarding one card from my 
hand, I can treat a monster card

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:31.670
in my graveyard as a spell card and 
set it in my Spell and Trap Card Zone!

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:34.640
How brash!  Vanish, Meklord!

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:42.490
The Continuous Trap Infinite 
Aura's effect activates.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:47.700
For every 100 points of damage, I 
place an Aura Counter on the card.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:52.450
It's over!

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:58.610
Team 5D's first duelist Jack Atlas 
defeated Team New World's Lucciano!

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:03.640
He won using his miraculous 
new power Red Nova Dragon!

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:04.970
He did it!

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:07.340
You're incredible, Jack!

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:11.690
This is a great start, Jack!  Keep 
it up and defeat the second duelist!

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:15.670
It's strange.  He defeated Meklord easily.

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:20.450
That was a nice way to lose, Lucciano.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:22.600
Be quiet!

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:28.600
Even though it's part of our 
strategy, that wasn't fun.

00:21:28.750 --> 00:21:30.610
But it's fine.

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:35.300
They stepped into hell 
and can no longer escape.

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:40.430
Yeah.  The countdown to 
their demise has begun.

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:11.740
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:17.120
If we shed the same tears, 
let's laugh together

00:22:17.220 --> 00:22:22.450
Freed reality forms phrases 
in the piercing beat

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:25.190
Our hearts resonate

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:30.430
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:37.070
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.970 --> 00:22:43.840
Waking in a dream  Stretch 
our hands toward the future

00:22:43.840 --> 00:22:48.910
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:49.610 --> 00:22:55.050
Repaint the darkness with 
the colors we envision

00:22:55.050 --> 00:23:03.630
Overlaying memories, bonds 
and hope creates future color

00:23:03.630 --> 00:23:09.230
We will draw it forever
